INSERT INTO `document_vector` VALUES (207, '数学', 151, '凸优化与对偶理论', '## 凸集与凸函数\n\n**凸集**：$$\\forall x,y \\in C, \\theta \\in [0,1], \\theta x + (1-\\theta)y \\in C$$。**凸函数**：$$f(\\theta x + (1-\\theta)y) \\le \\theta f(x) + (1-\\theta)f(y)$$。凸优化问题中局部最优即全局最优。\n\n例子：$$f(x) = x^2$$ 是凸函数，$$f(x) = \\sin x$$ 不是。\n\n## 凸优化问题\n\n标准形式：$$\\min f(x) \\text{ s.t. } g_i(x) \\le 0, h_j(x) = 0$$。**拉格朗日对偶**：$$L(x, \\lambda, \\nu) = f(x) + \\sum \\lambda_i g_i(x) + \\sum \\nu_j h_j(x)$$。对偶问题为 $$\\max_{\\lambda \\ge 0, \\nu} \\inf_x L(x, \\lambda, \\nu)$$。\n\n例子：线性规划的对偶仍为线性规划。\n\n## 对偶理论与应用\n\n- **强对偶性**：Slater 条件下成立。\n- **KKT 条件**：最优解的必要条件。\n- **支持向量机（SVM）**：对偶形式便于核方法。\n\n例子：用 `cvxpy` 求解凸优化问题。\n\n```python\nimport cvxpy as cp\nx = cp.Variable(2)\nobjective = cp.Minimize(cp.sum_squares(x - [1, 2]))\nconstraints = [x >= 0]\nprob = cp.Problem(objective, constraints)\nprob.solve()\nprint(x.value)\n```', '[-0.03782589,0.017694611,-0.031972624,0.017823033,-0.009513916,-0.014521817,0.0028154338,0.012257907,0.020274494,0.039058093,-0.034186795,0.021886496,-0.006045994,0.030247163,0.0067252098,-0.012019428,-0.022960976,0.018307924,0.029040242,-0.03377227,-0.021055102,0.020521719,-0.024179474,0.009136838,-0.036355756,-0.004705909,-0.0084370375,-0.0066121113,-0.028349258,0.037306678,0.018236287,0.02784837,0.042004064,-0.07055637,-0.02251192,-0.050636142,7.9272833E-4,-0.019241245,-0.024863368,0.013758717,-0.014582519,0.016485775,0.03932619,-0.008159293,-0.0057929154,-0.04546954,-0.018161787,-0.035915222,-0.0064541516,-3.021721E-4,-0.03643174,-0.011255528,0.03756288,-0.01881,0.040160686,0.025661174,-0.026592271,-8.670533E-4,-0.07476115,-0.019136501,-0.004176768,0.027491013,-0.049921356,0.031918548,0.024502732,0.028058087,-0.03259991,-5.607866E-4,0.0044105486,-0.017726336,0.015051643,0.061803058,0.002910237,-0.041508216,-0.029316593,-0.019027198,0.006221832,0.006826643,-0.011817636,-0.011734121,-0.005908333,2.9237734E-5,-0.03328072,-0.043066602,-0.017248824,-0.0043183,0.016639031,0.023901746,-0.009